;; Card c0d8c251: a hurt body (4 hp, under the risky 6) that cannot heal (hunger drained food under 18, nothing edible carried)
;; hunts a pig it only knows of: get-food is never held by :low-health, and a pig inside the noted-walk range but behind a wall is
;; walked up to, not given up on ("1 found, 0 legs; no food source is known").
;; A stone wall x 10, z 10..22, y 0..2 stands between the body (x 4) and the pig (x 14); the body walks round its end.
;; Should-succeed: the pig is hunted and eaten; a fragile body walks out only past the dawn grace, so the call starts at noon, with no :low-health wait.
;; Should-fail: none (a negative needs a world with no animals; the search walks off the plot).
{:defaults
 {:tags [:survival :get-food :hurt]
  :time :day :time-why :dawn-decision
  :plot {:height 6 :length 40 :width 32}
  :body {:at [4.5 0 16.5] :yaw 270 :settle-s 2}
  :limit-s 150}
 :cases
 [{:name "hurt-body-hunts-the-pig-behind-a-wall"
   :blocks [[:fill [10 0 10] [10 2 22] "stone"]]
   :act [[:time-set 6000] [:summon "pig" [14.5 0 16.5] "{NoAI:1b}"]
         [:rcon "effect give $BODY minecraft:hunger 5 243 true"] [:until-effect-gone "hunger" 30]
         [:rcon "damage $BODY 18 minecraft:generic"]
         [:job (jobs.survival.get-food {})]]
   :expect [{:event {:source :job :kind :food.killed} :within-s 100}
            {:no-event {:source :job :kind :waiting :data {:reason :low-health}} :for-s 20 :until {:source :job :kind :food.killed}}]}]}
